	"description": [
		"This is the second 0.5 credit course in a two course series that is part of the Engineering Fellows experience. Students engage in a team-based engineering design project alongside a domain expert within the St. Olaf Community. Students also participate in professional development activities in preparation for continuing in the field of engineering and engage in a community based activity to support youth interest in engineering. Prerequisite: ENGR 390; Open only to juniors and seniors."
